<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>403 · authum</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<% @include('styles') %>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="brand">authum</div>
  <h1>403 Forbidden</h1>
  <div class="panel stack">
    <p class="msg-err"><%= @reason %></p>
    <table class="kv">
      <tbody>
        <tr><th>host</th><td><code><%= @host %></code></td></tr>
        <tr><th>path</th><td><code><%= @path %></code></td></tr>
        <tr><th>method</th><td><code><%= @method %></code></td></tr>
        <tr><th>site</th><td><code><%= @site_name %></code></td></tr>
        <tr><th>user</th><td><code><%= @user_name %></code></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <details>
      <summary>Details</summary>
      <p class="lede"><%= @hint %></p>
      <table class="kv">
        <tbody>
          <tr><th>X-Forwarded-Host</th><td><code><%= @fwd_host %></code></td></tr>
          <tr><th>X-Forwarded-Uri</th><td><code><%= @fwd_uri %></code></td></tr>
          <tr><th>X-Forwarded-Method</th><td><code><%= @method %></code></td></tr>
          <tr><th>X-Forwarded-Proto</th><td><code><%= @proto %></code></td></tr>
          <tr><th>site id</th><td><code><%= @site_id %></code></td></tr>
          <tr><th>user id</th><td><code><%= @user_label %></code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <ul class="help">
        <li>Traefik must send <code>X-Forwarded-Host</code>, <code>X-Forwarded-Uri</code>, and preferably <code>X-Forwarded-Method</code> / <code>X-Forwarded-Proto</code> to <code>/auth/verify</code>.</li>
        <li>Hosts belong in Admin → Sites (no scheme). ACL matches on numeric site id, not hostname.</li>
        <li>API clients still get a plain-text body; this page is for browsers.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
